## 5. 测试规范

### 5.1 测试分层

```
单元测试 (Vitest)       ← 工具函数、Composables、Store
    ↓
组件测试 (Vitest)       ← 组件渲染、交互、Props/Emits 验证
    ↓
E2E 测试 (Playwright)   ← 关键业务路径端到端验证
```

### 5.2 测试文件位置

```
src/
├── utils/
│   ├── format-date.ts
│   └── __tests__/
│       └── format-date.spec.ts
├── composables/
│   ├── use-table.ts
│   └── __tests__/
│       └── use-table.spec.ts
```

### 5.3 测试示例

```typescript
// __tests__/format-date.spec.ts
import { describe, it, expect } from 'vitest';
import { formatDate } from '../format-date';

describe('formatDate', () => {
  it('should format date correctly', () => {
    const result = formatDate(new Date('2025-01-15'), 'YYYY-MM-DD');
    expect(result).toBe('2025-01-15');
  });

  it('should handle empty value', () => {
    expect(formatDate(null)).toBe('-');
  });
});
```

